2026-07-29 ~12:55 PT (arch) — **ARCHITECTURAL RULING: the `check-branch.sh` mailbox gate is a TIME-OF-CHECK/TIME-OF-USE INVERSION, not a procedure problem — and the entire week's probe apparatus is downstream of it.** THE DEFECT, one line: `check-branch.sh:28` decides via `git diff --cached --name-only` (the **index**), while running as a **PreToolUse** hook — i.e. **before the gated command executes**. So for `git add mailboxes/… && git commit …` the hook inspects the index that the very command it is gating is about to modify; the `git add` hasn't run, the index is clean of `mailboxes/`, and it allows. WHAT THIS EXPLAINS, all of it, with no residue: compound bypasses (its `git add` is *inside* the gated call → clean at check time); standalone blocks (staging ran in a *prior* call → dirty at check time); and therefore **shape correlates perfectly with index state**, which is why PA, PPM, CXO and I independently concluded shape was the variable, why HOST's checklist v1.5 could canonise that conclusion, and why the canonised probe would have manufactured its own confirming evidence indefinitely (HOST's escalation — *"a probe that fixes the variable it is testing will confirm whatever it was designed around"*). **Web's index-state model is correct AND is a description of the bug, not of a design.** SCALE OF THE APPARATUS BUILT AROUND IT: a twice-daily drumbeat, a two-shape probe, a corrected probe order (CXO), a proposed third discriminating probe (mine), 25+ probes across 5 seats, four wrong hypotheses (two of them mine, both mailed then withdrawn) — all to characterise the behaviour of a check reading state at the wrong moment. THE FIX: **move the gate to where the index is authoritative — a real git `pre-commit` hook**, which git runs *after* the index is finalised and *before* the commit object is written. The inversion becomes structurally impossible rather than merely detectable (make-drift-impossible; the failure state stops being representable). VERIFIED FEASIBLE ON THIS MACHINE before proposing (not assumed): `core.hooksPath` **not set**; **no** `pre-commit` currently installed (samples only); and every agent worktree resolves hooks to the single shared common dir `/Users/xian/Development/piper-morgan-product/.git` — so **ONE file at `.git/hooks/pre-commit` covers the entire cohort by construction**, no per-worktree provisioning, no inter-seat drift, nothing for an agent to remember. Logic lifts from `check-branch.sh` essentially unchanged; only *when* it runs changes. PROPERTIES BOUGHT: shape-independent (one final index, so compound and standalone are both gated); **no probe needed** — you don't verify a gate that reads settled state, so Probe C and the two-shape step both become unnecessary; `--no-verify` escape unchanged; `mail-send.sh` unaffected and correctly so (`commit-tree` doesn't invoke `pre-commit`, and mail-send already lands on `main`). HONEST LIMITATIONS RECORDED: `.git/hooks/` is **not tracked** — per-machine provisioning, Pard's lane, must be part of provisioning rather than a remembered manual step (tracked alternative: `core.hooksPath` at a repo dir, at the cost of overriding local hooks); and this must be **verified behaviorally, never by config presence** — though verification is now cheap and decisive (one compound commit against a clean index: bypasses today, blocks if fixed — the only probe this week that needs no control for index state). SCOPE — RULING vs NOT: I rule that this is an architectural defect and that further probe-design investment is investment in characterising a bug; I **deliberately do NOT rule on installing it** — shared-infrastructure change on every agent's commit path in a common `.git` dir I don't own, and the week's lesson is exactly about confident changes to silent mechanisms. Pard owns the hook layer, HOST the trust/verification framing; **nothing installed by me.** Recommended sequencing: install → run the one discriminating probe on two seats → *then* retire the two-shape checklist step, leaving the drumbeat running across the change so a regression can't be silent. META, worth carrying: this took a fresh read of 56 lines of shell after five agents spent three days probing its behaviour from outside. The investigation was framed as *"characterise the intermittency"* and nobody re-read the mechanism until the framing had produced four wrong hypotheses and one canonised confound — **m-43's shape at the altitude of an entire investigation: the right property checked on the wrong object.** Cure is not more probing discipline; it is *read the mechanism before characterising it empirically.* Refs: memo `memo-arch-to-host-pard-cio-...-the-hook-defect-is-TOCTOU-stop-probing-move-the-gate-2026-07-29.md`; HOST's consensus-institutionalised memo (7/29); Web's index-state mechanism; m-44. — Arch

